Psyco Gundam
The Murasame Research Institute, a Newtype laboratory in Japan, developed this enormous transformable Mobile Armor (MA) for Cyber-Newtypes.

{x00}

{C:2335}Scopedog Red Shoulder Custom (Chirico){C:2332}
This is a custom machine that Chirico modified from a Scopedog.
Its left shoulder is painted red; true Red Shoulder machines have their right shoulders painted instead. Since it is not an official military modification, the details of its performance are unknown.

{x00}

{C:2335}Scopedog Turbo Custom{C:2332}
Also called Type 20, this machine was developed and outfitted exclusively for the Red Shoulders.
Its Jet Roller Dash improves mobility, and its computer's performance has also been altered. However, handling problems make it too difficult for some pilots to master, and it was produced only for a short time.

{x00}

