Ground Type Fatty
This Fatty was modified for high-mobility combat inland. It specializes in land operations and performs far better there than the standard Fatty.

{x00}

Ground Type Fatty
This version adds a missile pod to the Fatty modified for high-mobility inland combat, increasing its attack power.

