{x00}

Dankova
This is the personal machine of Getey of the Death Demon Squad. It uses aerial mines to stop its opponent, then attacks with a large Knuckle Shot.

{x00}

El-Darr
This is the personal machine of Bohn of the Death Demon Squad. Its only standard firearm is a Laserd Gun, but the extendable, retractable Snake Drills in both palms spin at high speed to destroy targets from within.

{x00}

Gashlan
This is the personal machine of Manjero of the Death Demon Squad. It uses its leg claws and Power Hand to immobilize its opponent, then destroys the target with its drill.

